## Problem

The API has no CORS (Cross-Origin Resource Sharing) headers. Browser requests from different origins will fail.

**File:** `apps/api/src/index.ts`

## Current State

No CORS handling present. Also missing OPTIONS handler for preflight requests.

## Required Change

Add CORS middleware:

```typescript
const corsHeaders = {
  "Access-Control-Allow-Origin": "*", // Or specific origin
  "Access-Control-Allow-Methods": "GET, POST, PUT, DELETE, OPTIONS",
  "Access-Control-Allow-Headers": "Content-Type, Authorization",
  "Access-Control-Max-Age": "86400",
};

// Handle preflight
if (request.method === "OPTIONS") {
  return new Response(null, { headers: corsHeaders });
}

// Add to all responses
return new Response(body, {
  headers: { ...corsHeaders, "Content-Type": "application/json" }
});
```

Or use a proper CORS middleware:

```typescript
const withCors = (response: Response): Response => {
  const headers = new Headers(response.headers);
  headers.set("Access-Control-Allow-Origin", "*");
  headers.set("Access-Control-Allow-Methods", "GET, POST, PUT, DELETE, OPTIONS");
  headers.set("Access-Control-Allow-Headers", "Content-Type, Authorization");
  return new Response(response.body, { ...response, headers });
};
```

